-- coa19-a1-delivery.l4: Part 25 (Company charges), Chapter A1 (Registration of company charges), cross-heading "Company charges":
-- ss 859A to 859G, lines 11599-11699 of ukpga-2006-46.txt. Layer 1: the law as the text states it, from nobody's point of view.
