--   `s 1158 the company is a UK-registered company` (keel, BOOLEAN suffices): s 859A(7) "company".
--   `s 738 the instrument is a debenture` (coa16, MAYBE BOOLEAN): s 859B(1).
-- Judgments the text hands to the court ("if the court is satisfied") are plain inputs (BOOLEAN): never guessed.
